    "body": "Found in https://pageshot.net/__version__ (bd71a5d):\r\n\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"source\": \"https://github.com/mozilla-services/pageshot/\",\r\n  \"description\": \"Page Shot application server\",\r\n  \"version\": \"November 15, 2016 13:54:53 UTC\",\r\n  \"commit\": \"bd71a5d\",\r\n  \"contentOrigin\": \"pageshot-usercontent.net\",\r\n  \"commitLog\": \"https://github.com/mozilla-services/pageshot/commits/bd71a5d\",\r\n  \"unincludedCommits\": \"https://github.com/mozilla-services/pageshot/compare/bd71a5d...master\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI just noticed that the [/terms](https://pageshot.net/terms) and [/privacy](https://pageshot.net/privacy) pages have beautiful footers with \"Terms\", \"Privacy Notice\", \"Report IP Infringement\", \"Send Feedback\" and \"GitHub\" links, but, the homepage doesn't:\r\n\r\n![privacy_notice](https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/557895/20688965/fdc76ee8-b577-11e6-9c92-66bd7b2f460a.png)\r\n**Figure 1:** Beautiful footer links.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n![page_shot__a_screenshot_tool_for_firefox](https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/557895/20688977/0b2b7296-b578-11e6-9c03-6a4486f45a40.png)\r\n**Figure 2:** GitHub logo in footer only. No links to our **Terms of Service** or **Privacy Notice**.",
